            "note": "Polygon, rectangle, ellipse and quadrant gating with auto-fit (snap to cluster). MFI statistics (median, geometric mean, CV%). Dot plot, histogram and density visualisation. Hierarchical gating with child plots.Exports gate hierarchies to FlowJo .wsp and Gating-ML 2.0 (ISAC open standard) for interoperability with FlowJo, R/flowWorkspace/CytoML and FCS Express. Imports FlowJo .wsp to read spillover/compensation matrix.",
